{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-for-science-discovery","title":"AI for Science 科学发现","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-frontier-research","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-for-science-科学发现\">AI for Science 科学发现</h1><p>过去几年，人工智能在自然科学里第一次交出了「新发现」而非「好工具」的成绩单：预测了两亿多个蛋白质结构，\n改进了悬置五十六年的矩阵乘法计数，把奥数几何做到金牌水平，让机器学习预报进入世界级气象机构的业务线。\n这个 hub 讲的就是这条线的完整图景——AI 在科学里做成了什么、为什么能做成、结果如何被验证、\n以及科学与出版制度正在承受怎样的冲击。</p>\n<p>先说定位。\n本仓库 <code>62_ai-frontier-research</code> 分类下的几个 hub 各有分工：预训练数据工程关注模型的原料侧，\nJEPA 与世界模型关注自监督表征的学习机制，可验证奖励训练关注后训练技术，安全框架关注对齐与管控。\n它们回答的都是「模型怎么造出来、怎么管住」；本 hub 是这个分类里唯一以学科成果为主线的一个，\n回答的是「模型在自然界面前拿到了什么结果」。\n两边的关系是引擎与里程表——理解训练技术有助于读懂方法细节，但读懂本 hub 不需要先读那些内容。</p>\n<p>全 hub 按四章递进，逻辑是「成果 → 推广 → 抽象 → 展望」。\n第一章以结构生物学为起点，因为这是 AI for Science 最成熟的战场：\nAlphaFold 谱系解决了预测问题，RFdiffusion 与 ESM 打开了设计问题，GNoME 和 MatterGen 则证明同样的思路能外溢到材料世界。\n第二章把这个范式推向非生命系统——算法发现、定理证明、天气与聚变，看它在数学与物理里的成色。\n第三章从案例中抽出方法论：发现即「搜索加偏置」，可信度取决于验证闭环的设计，而自动化实验室补上了物理世界的执行环节。\n第四章面向未来：AI 科学家 Agent 的真实水位、署名与评审制度的震荡，以及一份可以逐年核对的五年观察清单。</p>\n<p>推荐两条阅读路径。\n如果你是工程师或研究者背景，按章节顺序通读即可，每章三篇互为铺垫；\n如果你时间有限、只想要分析框架，可以先读方法论章的两篇（为什么能发现、验证闭环），再回头用这套透镜扫过前两章的案例。\n前置知识方面：线性代数与概率论的基本语言、对 Transformer 与扩散模型的直觉级了解、\n高中以上的理化生概念，足够覆盖全部十二篇；遇到具体系统的架构细节，文中都给出了足以理解的交代。</p>\n<p>需要提醒的是态度。\n这个领域的宣传密度极高，「AI 重新发明了科学」式的标题每周都在出现，\n但经得起核验的突破其实有清晰的共同结构——便宜的提议、诚实的裁判、快速的闭环。\n读完这个 hub，你应当带走的不只是一份系统清单，更是一套判断哪些声明值得相信的方法。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：想深入模型构造侧，可继续读同分类下的兄弟 hub——\n<a href=\"../pretraining-data-engineering/\">预训练数据工程</a>、\n<a href=\"../rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/\">可验证奖励训练</a>、<a href=\"../frontier-safety-frameworks/\">前沿安全框架</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-biology","title":"结构生物学革命","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/structural-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"alphafold-lineage","title":"AlphaFold 谱系：2 到 3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/structural-biology/alphafold-lineage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protein-design-wave","title":"蛋白质设计浪潮：RFdiffusion 与 ESM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/structural-biology/protein-design-wave"},{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-proteins","title":"蛋白质之外：RNA、材料与 GNoME","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/structural-biology/beyond-proteins"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"math-algorithms-physics","title":"数学、算法与物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/math-algorithms-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algorithm-discovery","title":"算法发现：FunSearch 与 AlphaEvolve","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/math-algorithms-physics/algorithm-discovery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geometry-and-proof","title":"几何与定理证明：AlphaGeometry 线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/math-algorithms-physics/geometry-and-proof"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-in-physics-systems","title":"物理系统中的 AI：天气与聚变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/math-algorithms-physics/ai-in-physics-systems"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"methodology","title":"方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-ai-discovers","title":"AI 为什么能做出发现：搜索与偏置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/methodology/why-ai-discovers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"verification-loops","title":"科学发现的验证闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/methodology/verification-loops"},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-driving-labs","title":"自驱动实验室","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/methodology/self-driving-labs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontier-outlook","title":"前沿与展望","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/frontier-outlook","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-scientist-agents","title":"AI 科学家 Agent 的尝试与局限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/frontier-outlook/ai-scientist-agents"},{"seq":2,"slug":"credit-publication","title":"署名、发表与同行评审冲击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/frontier-outlook/credit-publication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"next-five-years","title":"下一个五年的观察清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/ai-for-science-discovery/frontier-outlook/next-five-years"}]}]}